SCENE
ID=NORMAL_TEST_001
NAME=Normal Runtime Test
DESC=Repeating normal runtime test
CATEGORY=NORMAL
CAPABILITIES=
COLORS
amber=255,80,0
SCRIPT
MOVE BOTH POS 100 SPEED 100
WAIT TARGET
SET BOTH MAINLEDS COLOR amber
SET BOTH LENS COLOR amber
SHOW
WAIT 500ms
CLEAR BOTH MAINLEDS
CLEAR BOTH LENS
SHOW
WAIT 500ms
END
